  "prefLabel": "Mec 703.03 Required Supporting Material",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 703.03 Required Supporting Material.\n\n(a) If the applicant is seeking initial certification as a heating installer and heating equipment service personnel, they shall provide evidence of 2000 hours of field experience, by submitting either of the following:\n\n(1) A certificate showing the applicant successfully completion the NORA Technician Certification program at the silver or gold level which includes a final exam; or\n\n(2) Proof of current licensure in good standing from a state or regulatory board of licensure for oil heating service and oil-fired equipment installation.\n\nSource. #13631, eff 7-9-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mec700.html"
}
